# ABP Microservice Solution Template

## Solution Structure
```
MyMicroservice/
├── apps/
│   ├── web/                    # Web application
│   └── auth-server/            # Authentication server
├── gateways/
│   └── web-gateway/            # API gateway
├── services/
│   ├── administration/         # Admin service
│   ├── identity/              # Identity service
│   └── product/               # Business service
├── shared/
│   └── MyMicroservice.Shared/ # Shared contracts
└── etc/
    ├── docker/                # Docker files
    └── k8s/                   # Kubernetes manifests
```

## Key Concepts

### Service Communication
- **Synchronous**: HTTP calls, gRPC
- **Asynchronous**: Distributed events (RabbitMQ, Kafka)

### API Gateway
- Routes requests to services
- Handles authentication
- Rate limiting

### Distributed Events
```csharp
// Publishing
await _distributedEventBus.PublishAsync(new OrderCreatedEto { ... });

// Handling
public class OrderCreatedHandler : IDistributedEventHandler<OrderCreatedEto>
{
    public async Task HandleEventAsync(OrderCreatedEto eventData) { }
}
```

### Shared Module
Contains shared:
- Event Transfer Objects (ETOs)
- Integration service interfaces
- Constants
